# rooms — room declarations, exits, nested objects

"Rooms" by Test

Room kitchen "The smell of burnt coffee lingers."
    north: hallway
    east: garden

Room hallway "A narrow hallway."
    south: kitchen
    up: attic
    Object coat rack "A sturdy wooden rack."

Room garden "A walled garden."
    west: kitchen

Room attic "A dusty attic."
    down: hallway

test
    test "exits".
    test "up and down".

test "exits"
    go north. "hallway"
    go south. "kitchen"
    go east. "garden"
    go west. "kitchen"

test "up and down"
    go north. "hallway"
    go up. "attic"
    go down. "hallway"
